- mods/herdr-glass-agents, from `agents` (0.1.16): grouped by space by default, the fold
  chevron after the group's name, no unfold button on the rail.
- mods/herdr-glass-status, from `workspace-status` (0.1.16): no top border line; text
  further in.
- mods/herdr-glass-toast, from `toast` (0.1.16): a colour bar by level, the agent's live
  title in the body.

Each of those mods' main.js starts with a note of what was changed.

