Changes in this copy (derangga/nix, modules/herdr-glass), from herdr-glass bbea462:

- Every mod's main.js is now main.ts (TypeScript), built back to main.js with esbuild.
- The layout uses solid Catppuccin Macchiato colours and the catppuccin-macchiato theme
  instead of glass cards over a picture; it has no status bar, and adds herdr-review and
  beads toggles after the tab strip.
- mods/herdr-glass-bg (Appearance, background pictures) and mods/herdr-glass-status are
  removed; herdr-glass-chrome has no Appearance row.
- herdr-glass-spaces uses Catppuccin Macchiato avatar colours.

Changes in derangga/herdr-mods (src/paddock), from derangga/nix modules/herdr-glass:

- Renamed Paddock: the layout is layouts/paddock.json (preview layouts/paddock.svg) and
  each mods/herdr-glass-<name> is mods/paddock-<name>, with every mod name and asset path
  in the code changed to match. The `glass:` and `nix:` notes at the top of each main.ts
  still say what was changed from Herdr's mod.
- paddock-tabs: the tab strip scrolls without painting a scrollbar; a divider after the + button
  separates the tabs from the toggles (Annotate, Beads) that follow in the row.
